	// UnarchiveCompanyItem Bring a company folder, or a file in one, back from the archive
	//
	// BACK IN THE COMPANY'S LISTS, exactly where it always was.
	//
	// A FOLDER BRINGS BACK WHAT WENT WITH IT, and nothing that was archived by itself before.
	//
	// Bringing back what is not archived changes nothing and answers the same.
	//
	// ONE ITEM INSIDE AN ARCHIVED FOLDER IS NOT BROUGHT BACK ALONE: `409
	// inside_an_archived_folder`, and nothing changes. The refusal names the folder to bring
