	// A grant's `item_id` says where it was placed, which is where it is changed and ended.
	//
	// AN ENDED GRANT IS NOT LISTED. It reaches nothing.
	//
	// A COMPANY FILE IS NOT ASKED ABOUT HERE YET: `404`.
	//
	// A GRANT PLACED ON SOMETHING INSIDE THE FOLDER IS NOT LISTED YET (ONPLO-5772). A role on the
	// whole environment is not listed here either: it is the environment's, shown in Manage access.
	//
	// YOU NEED THE ITEM'S READ, as for seeing the item itself: who can touch a thing is answered
	// from the tree. Sharing it is the share permission, and changing or ending a grant asks it.
