	// ListLinkedFolderWithBody List a folder a link opens, with no account
	//
	// ONE PAGE OF A FOLDER A LINK OPENS, read-only: the linked folder itself, or a folder below it.
	// It is what Storage's link viewer shows after `openLink` handed over a browsing pass: browse
