	//
	// A MOVE KEEPS EVERYTHING. The item keeps its id, its history and its shares. On the version
	// line a move is one version, which both the old and the new folder record.
	//
	// INSIDE ONE ACCOUNT ENVIRONMENT. Nothing moves across account environments.
	//
	// SYSTEM STORAGE REFUSES IT, in both directions (`managed_by_app`). A FOLDER CANNOT MOVE INTO
	// A FOLDER INSIDE IT (`moves_into_itself`), NOR ONTO A NAME ALREADY TAKEN where it would land
	// (`name_taken`).
