	// IssueExportDownloadAddressWithResponse Ask for an address to download an export
	//
	// THE SAME RULE AS EVERY OTHER PROTECTED FILE: a short-lived address that carries its own
	// proof, checked when it is issued. The export lives seven days; an address to it lives
	// minutes, and is asked for again when it is needed.
	//
