	// ONLY A BUSINESS ACCOUNT ENVIRONMENT HAS A COMPANY'S LIMIT: in a personal one, start the
	// upload with `allow_over_limit_once`, and this answers `limit_is_yours`.
	//
	// YOU NEED `storage:upload-limit.approve`, held across the account environment.
