// GetCompanyStorageWithResponse The company's storage, and the id of its tree
//
// THE COMPANY'S TREE HAS AN ID OF ITS OWN, AND THIS IS WHERE IT IS READ, exactly as your
// personal storage's is. A call that makes a top-level company folder names the tree by
// this id.
