// A FOLDER GOES WITH EVERYTHING IN IT, and comes back whole.
//
// DELETING WHAT IS ALREADY IN TRASH CHANGES NOTHING AND ANSWERS THE SAME. Something that only
// went with a deleted folder is not there to delete: `404`.
