// ARCHIVE IS A STATE, NOT A PLACE. Nothing moved: the item keeps its history, its shares and
// its place, and still counts toward the quota. It is simply left out of the ordinary lists.
// Nothing archived ever expires.
//
// APP CONTENT ARCHIVED IN ITS OWN APP SHOWS UP HERE TOO, as archived. Storage shows that
// state and never sets it for another app's content.
