// MoveItemWithBodyWithResponse Move an item to another folder
//
// Its own operation because it has its own rules, and a field in a patch body cannot carry
// them.
//
// A MOVE KEEPS EVERYTHING. The item keeps its id, its history and its shares. On the version
// line a move is one version, which both the old and the new parent record.
//
// SYSTEM STORAGE REFUSES IT, in both directions: an item there cannot be moved out, and
// nothing of yours can be moved in (`managed_by_app`).
//
// A FOLDER CANNOT MOVE INTO ITSELF or into a folder inside it (`moves_into_itself`).
