// ONLY INSIDE YOUR PERSONAL STORAGE. Nothing moves across account environments at all: they
// share identity and nothing else, so you export and upload instead. Moving into company
// storage is `moveItemIntoCompany` (ONPLO-5534).
//
// YOU NEED THE PERMISSION ON BOTH: on the item you move, and on the folder it lands in. Both
// are asked in one question, and one missing is one refusal. Which permission depends on
// what you move: a file's move asks the file's, a folder's move asks the folder's.
//
// Takes any type of body and a specified content type, and returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
