//
// SWITCHING ON WHAT IS ON changes nothing and answers the same.
//
// NOTHING ELSE CHANGES: no file, no version, no other rule, and not when the folder was last
// updated.
//
// APP CONTENT IS GOVERNED BY THE APP THAT OWNS IT, so a folder in System Storage is refused
