// CompleteVersionUploadWithResponse Finish uploading a new version of a file
//
// THE NEW VERSION IS THE FILE'S FROM THIS MOMENT. It is what the file reads as, the file was
// last updated now, and the version it replaced stays as an earlier one. Its folder was not
// updated.
//
// NOTHING IS HALF-WRITTEN. An upload with a part missing is refused (`upload_incomplete`)
// and stays resumable; parts that come to another size than the start said are refused
// (`size_differs`). Neither changes the file.
//
// ASKING TWICE IS SAFE. Completing an upload that is already complete answers the same file
// and changes nothing.
//
