// it. Any other is `not_found`, and so is a file deleted while its version was going up.
//
// Returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
//
// Corresponds with POST /personal-storage/items/{item_id}/version-uploads/{upload_id}/completion (the `CompleteVersionUpload` operationId).
