// ListVersionsWithResponse A file's history
//
// EVERY SAVE IS CAPTURED, AND SHOWN AS WORK SESSIONS rather than keystrokes: one entry per
// author and editing period, newest first.
//
// THE BYTES OF HISTORY COUNT. Each entry says what it keeps, and the file's history line on
// the meter is their sum — it shrinks when history is trimmed.
//
// PER FILE. A folder's history is the history of what is inside it (`not_a_file`).
//
// YOU NEED THE FILE'S READ: whoever may open a file may see what it was.
//
// Returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
//
// Corresponds with GET /personal-storage/items/{item_id}/versions (the `ListVersions` operationId).
