// GetUploadWithResponse Where an upload stopped
//
// WHICH PARTS HAVE LANDED, so an upload resumes where it stopped — after a dropped
// connection, a closed laptop, a train tunnel — rather than starting again.
//
// A COMPLETED UPLOAD STILL ANSWERS, with `state: complete` and the file's id, so a completion
// whose answer was lost can be recovered by asking.
//
// Not gated: an upload is read only by whoever started it, and anybody else is answered
// `not_found`.
//
// Returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
//
// Corresponds with GET /personal-storage/uploads/{upload_id} (the `GetUpload` operationId).
